    "C6 (min AUC invariance): the first `check` run failed with max |dAUC| = 0.0030 because at the two extreme test vectors with a = e^3 float64 expit and the slip/guess map merge hundreds of distinct predictions (new ties); all six fixed starts gave |dAUC| = 0 with no new ties. The gate now applies to vectors that add no new ties (the six starts must be among them) and saturating vectors are recorded. Found before any fit and before any test access.",
